  "instructions": [
    "Heat the extra-virgin olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add the garlic and sauté for 30 to 60 seconds until fragrant but not browned. Check at 30 seconds.",
    "Add the baby spinach in handfuls, tossing constantly for 1 to 2 minutes until fully wilted. Check at 1 minute.",
